iranian-pos
===========

This repository contains Linux/Wine/Docker glue to run official Iranian
PC-POS Windows services on Linux.

It does NOT include, and you must NOT commit:

- PSP Windows installers, .exe, .dll, .pdb
- PSP PDFs, Word docs, or other vendor manuals
- Terminal IDs, merchant IDs, hashed terminal fields, or live credentials

Those files belong to the payment service providers (SEP / Saman, Iran Kish,
and others). Obtain them under your own contract and keep them private.

The MIT license covers only the files authored in this repository.
